<title>USA: Pulte Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Pulte Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.14		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			 26,738		   25,410</p>
<p> Revs		     738,236		  667,454</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,456		   27,308</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 income from continuing operations $25.3 million or $1.08 a share vs $23.5 million or $0.86 a share.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $7.17		    $2.13</p>
<p> Net			179,643		   58,346</p>
<p> Revs		   2,384,283		2,029,140</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,070		   27,358</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year income from continuing operations $63.2 million or $7.17 a share vs $48.8 million or $1.79 a share in 1995.</p>
<p>1996 year includes income from discontinued operations of $116.4 million, or $4.65 a share, vs $9.5 million, or $0.34 a share in 1995.</p>
